---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Mark from '../components/Mark.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
---
<Base
  title="YOLO Electronics Repair · West Sacramento"
  description="Board-level electronics repair in West Sacramento. Laptops, GPUs, DJ gear, power amps, retro."
>
  <Mark label="YOLO Y-trace logo" />
  <div>
    <h1>YOLO Electronics Repair</h1>
    <p class="sub">BOARD-LEVEL REPAIR · WEST SAC · 916</p>
  </div>
  <p class="tag">You let the smoke out. We put it back in.</p>
  <p class="note">One bench in West Sacramento that fixes electronics at the board. Find the part that failed, replace that part, keep the rest.</p>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>What's on the bench</h2>
    <ul class="chips">
      <li>LAPTOPS</li><li>GPUS</li><li>DJ GEAR</li><li>POWER AMPS</li><li>RETRO</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="note"><a href="/repairs/">What gets fixed, and what doesn't</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Two ways in</h2>
    <div class="ways">
      <div>
        <h3>Drop it off</h3>
        <p class="note">Local to West Sac or anywhere in the 916? Bring it by. Drop-off is by appointment, so send a request first.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Mail it in</h3>
        <p class="note">Not local? Box it up and ship it. You get the address by email once we've agreed on the repair.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Quote first</h2>
    <p class="note">You hear the price before any work starts. Nothing gets replaced until you say go.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Start here</h2>
    <p class="note">Say what it is and what it's doing. <a href="/request/">Request a repair</a> with the form, or write an email.</p>
    <div class="contact">
      <b>J1</b><span><a href="mailto:hello@yolorepair.com">hello@yolorepair.com</a></span>
      <b>J2</b><span><a href="https://instagram.com/yolo.repair">@yolo.repair</a></span>
      <b>J3</b><span>West Sacramento · mail-in welcome</span>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
